# Photographs, in development.
#
# Pointed at the deployed Worker rather than a local one, and deliberately NOT
# accompanied by VITE_CONTENT_URL. That asymmetry is the point: `npm run dev`
# should show the real pictures — an app full of empty grey frames is unusable
# to develop against — while still reading its CONTENT from the bundled copy,
# so local work is done against the catalogue in the repo and cannot be
# confused by whatever the Board changed in production this morning.
#
# Set VITE_MEDIA_URL=http://localhost:8787 to work against `wrangler dev`
# instead, once images have been put in the local bucket.
VITE_MEDIA_URL=https://kuk-saarthi-api.indiefluence-in-media.workers.dev
